<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial" style="" color="#ff6600"><i style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">&lt;Attach the following 3 flyers to Template: Insperity EAP Brochure, Legal Representation of a Deceased Employee, How to Support a Grieving Employee&gt;</i></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Hello <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">client name,</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Thank you for reaching out to me during this difficult time. My deepest sympathies to you and your team as you grieve the death of <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">employee name.</span> As we discussed on our call, I am attaching a flyer for you to give to <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">employee name</span>'s family or legal representative and information to help support your employees at this time.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>To begin the process for final payroll, please submit the employee termination form by following the steps below:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ul><li><font face="arial"><a href="https://portal.insperity.com">https://portal.insperity.com</a></font></li><li><font face="arial">Go to COMPANY - Manage Employees</font></li><li><font face="arial">Click on employee name</font></li><li><font face="arial">Over to the left check on 'Termination'</font></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">I will notify your payroll specialist, <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">PS nam</span>e, who will reach out to you shortly to assist with finalizing <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">employee name'</span>s paycheck.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>I also attached the Employee Assistance Program flyer which details ancillary benefits such as mental health support including grief counseling. This benefit is available to each of your employees individually at no charge as well as to <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">employee name</span>'s family members. Optum can provide critical incident support to your organization during this time if needed. If you feel onsite support is needed, please let me know and I will initiate that request on your behalf.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">KDM name</span>, I am truly sorry for this loss to you and your team. Please do not hesitate to reach out if you need anything further.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Sincerely,</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>